tilayers and use this information to extract the activation energy for interdiffusion in this system.\",\"affiliations\":[{\"id\":\"aff_1\",\"label\":\"1\",\"text\":\"Cornell High Energy Synchrotron Source, Cornell University, Ithaca, NY 14853\"},{\"id\":\"aff_2\",\"label\":\"2\",\"text\":\"Department of Materials Science and Engineering, Johns Hopkins University, Baltimore, MD 21218\"},{\"id\":\"aff_3\",\"label\":\"3\",\"text\":\"School of Applied and Engineering Physics, Cornell University, Ithaca, NY 14853\"}],\"arxiv_id\":null,\"authors\":[{\"affiliation_refs\":[\"aff_1\"],\"email\":\"hj335@cornell.edu\",\"full_name\":\"Howie Joress\",\"id\":\"author_1\",\"is_corresponding\":true,\"orcid\":null},{\"affiliation_refs\":[\"aff_2\"],\"email\":null,\"full_name\":\"Shane Arlington\",\"id\":\"author_2\",\"is_corresponding\":false,\"orcid\":null},{\"affiliation_refs\":[\"aff_2\"],\"email\":null,\"full_name\":\"Timothy P. Weihs\",\"id\":\"author_3\",\"is_corresponding\":false,\"orcid\":null},{\"affiliation_refs\":[\"aff_1\",\"aff_3\"],\"email\":null,\"full_name\":\"Joel D. Brock\",\"id\":\"author_4\",\"is_corresponding\":false,\"orcid\":null},{\"affiliation_refs\":[\"aff_1\"],\"email\":null,\"full_name\":\"Arthur R. Woll\",\"id\":\"author_5\",\"is_corresponding\":false,\"orcid\":null}],\"doi\":null,\"funding\":[{\"funder\":\"National Science Foundation\",\"grant_id\":\"DMR1332208\"}],\"keywords\":[],\"language\":\"en\",\"publication_date\":\"2018-12-11\",\"publisher\":null,\"subtitle\":null,\"title\":\"X-ray reflectivity with a twist: quantitative time-resolved X-ray reflectivity using monochromatic synchrotron radiation\",\"url\":null,\"venue\":null},\"datasets\":[{\"dataset_description\":\"Time-resolved XRR during the annealing of Al/Ni nano-scale multilayers.\",\"dataset_name\":\"qXRR\",\"facility_refs\":[\"facility_1\"],\"id\":\"dataset_1\",\"measurement_mode\":[\"TimeScan\"],\"measurement_technique\":\"X-ray reflectivity\",\"purpose\":\"measurement\",\"sample_refs\"